8:{"metadata":[["$","title","0",{"children":"Michigan Dismissal Shows Problems for Prosecutors of 2020 Fake Electors"}],["$","meta","1",{"name":"description","content":"A judge in Michigan has dismissed charges against 15 people who were trying to falsify Donald Trump as the winner of the 2020 presidential election. The judge determined there was no fraudulent intent."}],["$","meta","2",{"name":"author","content":"Lauren Jacobs"}],["$","meta","3",{"name":"keywords","content":"us, news, Michigan Dismissal Shows Problems for Prosecutors of 2020 Fake Electors"}],["$","meta","4",{"name":"script:ld+json","content":"{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"NewsArticle\",\"headline\":\"Michigan Dismissal Shows Problems for Prosecutors of 2020 Fake Electors\",\"datePublished\":\"October 13, 2025\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"PressoraHub\",\"logo\":{\"@type\":\"ImageObject\",\"url\":\"https://www.pressorahub.com/pressorahub-icon.webp\"}},\"image\":\"https://www.pressorahub.com/images/michigan-fake-electors-case-dismissal.webp\",\"url\":\"https://www.pressorahub.com/us/michigan-dismissal-highlights-challenges-in-prosecuting-2020-fake-electors\",\"articleBody\":\"In a major and closely watched legal development, Ingham County District Court Judge Kristen D. Simmons has formally dismissed criminal charges against 15 indiv\",\"keywords\":\"us, news\"}"}],["$","link","5",{"rel":"canonical","href":"https://www.pressorahub.com/us/michigan-dismissal-highlights-challenges-in-prosecuting-2020-fake-electors"}],["$","meta","6",{"property":"og:title","content":"Michigan Dismissal Shows Problems for Prosecutors of 2020 Fake Electors"}],["$","meta","7",{"property":"og:description","content":"A judge in Michigan has dismissed charges against 15 people who were trying to falsify Donald Trump as the winner of the 2020 presidential election. The judge determined there was no fraudulent intent."}],["$","meta","8",{"property":"og